Package: Rmedio
Type: Package
Title: Read and Write Medical Imaging Data with 'libmedio'
Version: 1.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jens", "Maus", email = "mail@jens-maus.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Helmholtz-Zentrum Dresden-Rossendorf (HZDR)", role = "cph",
           comment = "copyright holder of the bundled 'libmedio' sources"))
Description: Interface to the 'libmedio' C++ library
    <https://github.com/hzdr-MedImaging/libmedio>, which reads and writes
    medical imaging data formats used in nuclear medicine (PET). The
    package currently reads and writes ECAT 6 and ECAT 7 image volumes.
    The 'libmedio' sources are bundled with the package.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Copyright: see file COPYRIGHTS
URL: https://github.com/hzdr-MedImaging/libmedio
BugReports: https://github.com/hzdr-MedImaging/libmedio/issues
Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.11.2)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: jsonlite
SystemRequirements: Qt5 (Core module), zlib, pkg-config
Encoding: UTF-8
